# university library subscription (Journal of Finance, Elsevier, EBSCO,
# newspapers, books). Redistributing them publicly is copyright
# infringement and violates the library licence. They must never be
# committed, and this rule is why the repository was rebuilt once.
# ======================================================================
zhishiku/
literature/
*.pdf
*.doc
*.docx
*.ppt
*.pptx
*.epub
*.mobi
*.djvu

